      "writtenOn": "2018-12-17T09:53:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see how we can do anything about this now while enforce_scope\u003dFalse is still default and being used by devstack.\n\nI think in the future it makes sense to open this up to domain admins and project admins (or project readers?) to list subprojects of the project they are scoped to, even listing just one project makes sense for the sake of completeness and ease of use for clients, even if it\u0027s a little redundant. I just don\u0027t see how we can accomplish that right now, while scoping to a project is still essentially the only way to do administrative actions.",
