      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I understand correctly, you\u0027re not sure if we can modify the response in this way while `keystone.conf [oslo_policy] enforce_scope \u003d False` because that would be a backward incompatible, breaking change?\n\nAnother option we have would be to check the value of that configuration option here and modify the response accordingly. Ultimately changing line 135 to:\n\n  if self.oslo_context.project_id and CONF.oslo_policy.enforce_scope:\n\nIt would allow per-project users only see what they should while allowing project-scoped tokens to be used for administrative tasks until operators do their migrations.",
