      "writtenOn": "2019-01-07T09:25:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t really like the idea of peeking into config in order to change the results of the API. I think what I\u0027d like to see is this:\n\n* a system-scoped admin or reader can list all projects (this will still work for project-scoped admins with enforce_scope\u003dfalse for the time being)\n* a domain-scoped admin or reader can list all projects in their domain (won\u0027t break CI because we don\u0027t use domain admins for anything)\n* a project-scoped admin or reader can\u0027t list projects - listing one project isn\u0027t useful enough to be worth the extra complexity imo\n* defer dealing with hierarchical projects until enforce_scope is gone",
